<div class="container my-5">
  <h1 class="text-center animate__animated animate__fadeInDown display-4 fw-bold my-5" style="font-family: 'Aboreto', cursive; color: #333;">
   My Projects
  </h1>
  
  <div class="row row-cols-1 row-cols-md-2 row-cols-xl-3 g-4">
    
    <!-- FindWay -->
    <div class="col">
      <div class="card h-100 shadow-lg border-0 rounded-4">
        <%= image_tag "findway.png", class: "card-img-top rounded-top-4", alt: "FindWay project" %>
        <div class="card-body">
          <h5 class="card-title fw-bold text-primary">FindWay</h5>
           <a href="https://findway.pro" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            findway.pro
           </a>
           <p class="card-text">
            A search engine for lost people and items. Built with Ruby on Rails, PostgreSQL, and Bootstrap.
          </p>
          <details>
            <summary class="text-primary" style="cursor: pointer;">Read more…</summary>
            <p class="mt-2 small">
               A socially impactful search engine helping people locate missing loved ones, pets, or stolen valuables. 
               Built from scratch with multilingual support, secure authentication via Devise and OmniAuth, and AWS S3 for media storage. 
               Designed to be fast, intuitive, and mobile-friendly — with a focus on real needs during wartime.
            </p>
            </details>
          <p class="small text-muted mt-2">Stack: Ruby on Rails, i18n, OmniAuth, Docker, S3</p>
          <a href="https://findway.pro" class="btn btn-sm shadow"
             target="_blank"
             style="background:linear-gradient(90deg, #246bfd 0%, #18e1b5 100%); color:#fff; border:none; border-radius:12px;">
             🌍 Visit project
           </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Shiny Dashboard -->
    <div class="col">
      <div class="card h-100 shadow-lg border-0 rounded-4">
        <%= image_tag "shiny-dashboard.png", class: "card-img-top rounded-top-4", alt: "Shiny Dashboard" %>
        <div class="card-body">
          <h5 class="card-title fw-bold text-success">UkrCar Analytics</h5>
           <a href="https://statauto.net" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            statauto.net
           </a>
          <p class="card-text">
            An interactive Shiny dashboard analyzing the Ukrainian automotive market (2017–2023).
          </p>
          <details>
            <summary class="text-success" style="cursor: pointer;">Read more…</summary>
            <p class="mt-2 small">
               A master's thesis project: a fully interactive R/Shiny dashboard tracking vehicle registrations in Ukraine (2017–2023). 
               Features include dynamic plots, time series forecasting, linear regression, model-(ARIMA), and advanced ETL workflows. 
               Designed for policymakers, economists, and automotive analysts.
            </p>
            </details>
           <p class="small text-muted mt-2">
            Stack: R, Shiny, Plotly, Leaflet, ETL, Time Series, ARIMA, Linear Regression, S3, Imgix, Docker
           </p>
           <a href="https://statauto.net" class="btn btn-sm shadow"
             target="_blank"
             style="background:linear-gradient(90deg, #246bfd 0%, #18e1b5 100%); color:#fff; border:none; border-radius:12px;">
             🌍 Visit project
           </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Maksym Social -->
    <div class="col">
      <div class="card h-100 shadow-lg border-0 rounded-4">
        <%= image_tag "maksym-social.png", class: "card-img-top rounded-top-4", alt: "Maksym Social Network" %>
        <div class="card-body">
          <h5 class="card-title fw-bold text-dark">Maksym Social </h5>
            <%= link_to "nenashev.net", articles_path %>
          <p class="card-text">
            A multilingual social network with tweets, articles, avatars and full user management.
          </p>
          <details>
            <summary class="text-dark" style="cursor: pointer;">Read more…</summary>
            <p class="mt-2 small">
             A custom-built social network supporting tweets, blog articles, avatars, multilingual interface, and profile editing. 
             Includes role-based access control, responsive UI, Devise-based authentication, and image uploads via ActiveStorage. 
             Created to explore full-stack Rails architecture and user-centric UX design.
            </p>
            </details>
          <p class="small text-muted mt-2">Stack: Ruby on Rails, Bootstrap 5, i18n, Docker, S3</p>
          <a href="<%= articles_path %>"
             class="btn btn-sm shadow"
             style="background:linear-gradient(90deg, #246bfd 0%, #18e1b5 100%); color:#fff; border:none; border-radius:12px;">
             🌍 Visit articles
          </a>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
   
    <!-- PromoFindWay Landing -->
<div class="col">
  <div class="card h-100 shadow-lg border-0 rounded-4">
    <%= image_tag "promofindway-pro.png", class: "card-img-top rounded-top-4", alt: "PromoFindWay Landing" %>
    <div class="card-body">
      <h5 class="card-title fw-bold text-primary">PromoFindWay.pro</h5>
      <%= link_to "promofindway.pro", "https://promofindway.pro", target: "_blank" %>
      <p class="card-text">
        A multilingual landing page for the FindWay project, built with <b>Sinatra</b> and featuring seamless i18n integration and smooth animations.
      </p>
      <details>
        <summary class="text-primary" style="cursor: pointer;">Read more…</summary>
        <p class="mt-2 small">
          This is a live presentation site and gateway for the FindWay search platform.<br>
          • <b>Internationalization</b>: Supports English, Ukrainian, and Polish via flexible YAML-based i18n.<br>
          • <b>Modern design</b>: Adaptive, clean Bootstrap 5 UI with animated elements.<br>
          • <b>Production-ready</b>: Dockerized, reverse-proxied with Nginx, and secured with HTTPS via Let's Encrypt.<br>
          • <b>Role</b>: Full cycle — from idea and design to infrastructure and deployment.
        </p>
      </details>
      <p class="small text-muted mt-2">Stack: Ruby, Sinatra, ERB, Bootstrap 5, i18n, Docker, Nginx, Certbot</p>
      <%#= link_to "🌍 Visit landing", "https://promofindway.pro", class: "btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm", target: "_blank" %>
      <a href="https://promofindway.pro" class="btn btn-sm shadow"
             target="_blank"
             style="background:linear-gradient(90deg, #246bfd 0%, #18e1b5 100%); color:#fff; border:none; border-radius:12px;">
             🌍 Visit project
           </a>
     </div>
  </div>
</div>
    
    <!-- FindWay AI Moderator -->
<div class="col">
  <div class="card h-100 shadow-lg border-0 rounded-4">
    <%= image_tag "findway-aimod.png", class: "card-img-top rounded-top-4", alt: "FindWay AI Moderator" %>
    <div class="card-body">
      <h5 class="card-title fw-bold text-info">FindWay AI Moderator</h5>
      <a href="#" class="link-secondary disabled" tabindex="-1" aria-disabled="true">
        (in progress, coming soon)
      </a>
      <p class="card-text">
        Advanced AI-powered content moderation engine for the FindWay platform, leveraging <b>R</b>, <b>Keras</b>, and <b>TensorFlow</b> for robust and ethical content filtering.
      </p>
      <details>
        <summary class="text-info" style="cursor: pointer;">Read more…</summary>
        <p class="mt-2 small">
          • <b>Purpose</b>: Automatically detect and block toxic, offensive, or unwanted content before publication.<br>
          • <b>Technology</b>: Deep learning models trained on multilingual datasets, integrated directly into the FindWay workflow.<br>
          • <b>Flexibility</b>: Real-time inference, customizable moderation policies for various languages and scenarios.<br>
          • <b>Impact</b>: Reduces manual moderation workload, protects the community, and helps comply with regulations.
        </p>
      </details>
      <p class="small text-muted mt-2">
        Stack: R, Keras, TensorFlow, Python (interoperability), Docker, API integration
      </p>
      <a href="#" class="btn btn-outline-info btn-sm disabled" tabindex="-1" aria-disabled="true">
        🚧 In development
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

  </div>
</div>
